WEBVTT

00:00:58.346 --> 00:01:00.389
I was receiving free designer clothes;

00:01:00.389 --> 00:01:02.809
I was double-kissing
my way across the globe.

00:01:02.975 --> 00:01:03.976
(Laughter)

00:01:03.976 --> 00:01:04.977
I was.

00:01:05.520 --> 00:01:08.564
And, you know, it was everything
that I ever wanted it to be,

00:01:08.564 --> 00:01:12.735
and then one day I realized
I was only pretending to be happy.

00:01:14.153 --> 00:01:18.241
But I couldn’t blow up my good life
in my prime earning years, right?

00:01:19.450 --> 00:01:20.451
Wrong.

00:01:21.119 --> 00:01:24.122
Which leads me to lessons
my mother Lolly taught me.

00:01:24.455 --> 00:01:26.624
Lolly’s number one lesson:

00:01:26.624 --> 00:01:28.292
don’t settle.

00:01:29.710 --> 00:01:30.711
Don’t settle.